{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-architecture","title":"智能体架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/claude-code-architecture/agent-and-task/agent-architecture","wordCount":1469,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"智能体架构\">智能体架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AgentTool 是 Claude Code 创建<strong>子 agent</strong> 的工具：子 agent 作为独立执行单元（通常是 fork 进程）运行，拥有自己的对话上下文与工具集，又可通过<strong>隔离模式</strong>按需共享父 agent 的资源。它支持五种子类型（<code>general</code> / <code>explore</code> / <code>plan</code> / <code>verify</code> / <code>guide</code>）与五种隔离模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type SubagentType = &#39;general&#39; | &#39;explore&#39; | &#39;plan&#39; | &#39;verify&#39; | &#39;guide&#39;;&#10;type IsolationMode = &#39;fork&#39; | &#39;worktree&#39; | &#39;remote&#39; | &#39;in-process&#39; | &#39;background&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubagentType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'general'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'explore'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'plan'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'verify'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'guide'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IsolationMode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fork'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'worktree'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'remote'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in-process'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'background'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离模式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>fork</code></td>\n<td>继承父上下文</td>\n<td>需要共享已有上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>worktree</code></td>\n<td>git worktree 隔离</td>\n<td>改代码而不污染主工作区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>remote</code></td>\n<td>运行在远端环境</td>\n<td>云端/沙箱执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>in-process</code></td>\n<td>同进程内运行</td>\n<td>轻量、低开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>background</code></td>\n<td>后台长期运行</td>\n<td>耗时任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>要点：</strong> 隔离模式决定「子 agent 与父 agent 的边界在哪」——是共享上下文（fork），还是连文件系统都隔离（worktree）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"agenttool-核心设计\">AgentTool 核心设计</h2><p>AgentTool 是 Claude Code 中创建子 agent 的核心工具，它将子 agent 作为独立的执行单元（通常是 fork 进程）来运行。每个子 agent 拥有独立的对话上下文和工具集，但可以通过多种隔离模式共享父 agent 的资源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AgentToolInput {&#10;  description: string;&#10;  prompt: string;&#10;  subagent_type: SubagentType;&#10;  model?: &#39;sonnet&#39; | &#39;opus&#39; | &#39;haiku&#39;;&#10;  run_in_background?: boolean;&#10;  isolation?: IsolationMode;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type SubagentType = &#39;general&#39; | &#39;explore&#39; | &#39;plan&#39; | &#39;verify&#39; | &#39;guide&#39;;&#10;type IsolationMode = &#39;fork&#39; | &#39;worktree&#39; | &#39;remote&#39; | &#39;in-process&#39; | &#39;background&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AgentToolInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  subagent_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubagentType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sonnet'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'opus'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'haiku'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  run_in_background</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IsolationMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubagentType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'general'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'explore'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'plan'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'verify'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'guide'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IsolationMode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fork'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'worktree'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'remote'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in-process'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'background'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PARENT[&quot;父 Agent&quot;] --&gt; AGENT_TOOL[&quot;AgentTool.call()&quot;]&#10;    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; FORK[&quot;fork&lt;br/&gt;继承上下文&quot;]&#10;    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; WORKTREE[&quot;worktree&lt;br/&gt;git 隔离&quot;]&#10;    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; REMOTE[&quot;remote&lt;br/&gt;CCR 环境&quot;]&#10;    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; INPROC[&quot;in-process&lt;br/&gt;同进程 teammate&quot;]&#10;    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; BG[&quot;background&lt;br/&gt;后台运行&quot;]&#10;&#10;    FORK --&gt; CHILD1[&quot;子 Agent 进程&quot;]&#10;    WORKTREE --&gt; CHILD2[&quot;独立工作树&quot;]&#10;    REMOTE --&gt; CHILD3[&quot;远程环境&quot;]&#10;    INPROC --&gt; CHILD4[&quot;同进程线程&quot;]&#10;    BG --&gt; CHILD5[&quot;后台任务&quot;]\">graph TD\n    PARENT[\"父 Agent\"] --&gt; AGENT_TOOL[\"AgentTool.call()\"]\n    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; FORK[\"fork&lt;br/&gt;继承上下文\"]\n    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; WORKTREE[\"worktree&lt;br/&gt;git 隔离\"]\n    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; REMOTE[\"remote&lt;br/&gt;CCR 环境\"]\n    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; INPROC[\"in-process&lt;br/&gt;同进程 teammate\"]\n    AGENT_TOOL --&gt; BG[\"background&lt;br/&gt;后台运行\"]\n\n    FORK --&gt; CHILD1[\"子 Agent 进程\"]\n    WORKTREE --&gt; CHILD2[\"独立工作树\"]\n    REMOTE --&gt; CHILD3[\"远程环境\"]\n    INPROC --&gt; CHILD4[\"同进程线程\"]\n    BG --&gt; CHILD5[\"后台任务\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离模式</th>\n<th>进程模型</th>\n<th>资源共享</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>fork</code></td>\n<td>子进程</td>\n<td>继承父上下文</td>\n<td>通用子任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>worktree</code></td>\n<td>子进程 + git</td>\n<td>git worktree 隔离</td>\n<td>并行修改不同分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>remote</code></td>\n<td>远程进程</td>\n<td>完全隔离</td>\n<td>CCR 远程执行环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>in-process</code></td>\n<td>同进程</td>\n<td>共享内存空间</td>\n<td>teammate 协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>background</code></td>\n<td>后台进程</td>\n<td>最小共享</td>\n<td>长时间运行任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> fork 模式是最常用的隔离模式，它通过继承父 agent 的对话上下文实现 prompt cache 共享，避免了重复的 cache_creation token 消耗。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"五种隔离模式详解\">五种隔离模式详解</h2><p>每种隔离模式在进程边界、文件系统访问和缓存策略上有不同的取舍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createSubagent(input: AgentToolInput, parentContext: ToolUseContext): SubagentHandle {&#10;  switch (input.isolation) {&#10;    case &#39;fork&#39;:&#10;      return forkSubagent(input, parentContext);&#10;    case &#39;worktree&#39;:&#10;      return worktreeSubagent(input, parentContext);&#10;    case &#39;remote&#39;:&#10;      return remoteSubagent(input, parentContext);&#10;    case &#39;in-process&#39;:&#10;      return inProcessSubagent(input, parentContext);&#10;    case &#39;background&#39;:&#10;      return backgroundSubagent(input, parentContext);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function forkSubagent(input: AgentToolInput, parentContext: ToolUseContext): SubagentHandle {&#10;  const childContext = {&#10;    ...parentContext,&#10;    conversationHistory: [...parentContext.conversationHistory],&#10;    promptCachePrefix: parentContext.promptCachePrefix,&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return spawnChildProcess(input.prompt, childContext);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createSubagent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AgentToolInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parentContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolUseContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubagentHandle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (input.isolation) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fork'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forkSubagent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input, parentContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'worktree'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worktreeSubagent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input, parentContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'remote'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> remoteSubagent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input, parentContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in-process'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inProcessSubagent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input, parentContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'background'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> backgroundSubagent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input, parentContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forkSubagent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AgentToolInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parentContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolUseContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubagentHandle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> childContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parentContext,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    conversationHistory: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parentContext.conversationHistory],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    promptCachePrefix: parentContext.promptCachePrefix,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> spawnChildProcess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.prompt, childContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph fork[&quot;fork 模式&quot;]&#10;        FP[&quot;父进程&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;继承上下文&quot;| FC[&quot;子进程&quot;]&#10;        FP -.-&gt;|&quot;共享 cache prefix&quot;| FC&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph worktree[&quot;worktree 模式&quot;]&#10;        WP[&quot;父进程&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;git worktree add&quot;| WC[&quot;子进程&quot;]&#10;        WC --&gt;|&quot;独立工作目录&quot;| WD[&quot;branch-worktree/&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph inprocess[&quot;in-process 模式&quot;]&#10;        IP[&quot;主线程&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;共享内存&quot;| IT[&quot;teammate 线程&quot;]&#10;        IP &lt;--&gt;|&quot;消息传递&quot;| IT&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph fork[\"fork 模式\"]\n        FP[\"父进程\"] --&gt;|\"继承上下文\"| FC[\"子进程\"]\n        FP -.-&gt;|\"共享 cache prefix\"| FC\n    end\n\n    subgraph worktree[\"worktree 模式\"]\n        WP[\"父进程\"] --&gt;|\"git worktree add\"| WC[\"子进程\"]\n        WC --&gt;|\"独立工作目录\"| WD[\"branch-worktree/\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph inprocess[\"in-process 模式\"]\n        IP[\"主线程\"] --&gt;|\"共享内存\"| IT[\"teammate 线程\"]\n        IP &lt;--&gt;|\"消息传递\"| IT\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>prompt cache</th>\n<th>文件系统</th>\n<th>网络</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>fork</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n<td>快速子任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>worktree</td>\n<td>不共享</td>\n<td>git worktree</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n<td>并行代码修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>remote</td>\n<td>不共享</td>\n<td>远程文件系统</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>沙箱执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>in-process</td>\n<td>不共享</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n<td>实时协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>background</td>\n<td>不共享</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n<td>异步长任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>fork 模式继承父 agent 的 <code>conversationHistory</code>，这意味着子 agent 的 API 请求可以命中父 agent 已建立的 prompt cache，显著减少重复的 cache_creation 开销。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> worktree 模式通过 <code>git worktree add</code> 创建独立的工作目录，适合需要在不同分支上并行修改代码的场景，如同时修复多个 bug。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内置-agent-定义\">内置 Agent 定义</h2><p>Claude Code 预定义了多个内置 agent，每个 agent 有特定的用途、工具集和系统提示。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BuiltinAgentDefinition {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  systemPrompt: string;&#10;  allowedTools: string[];&#10;  model: &#39;sonnet&#39; | &#39;opus&#39; | &#39;haiku&#39;;&#10;  autoBackground: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const GENERAL_PURPOSE_AGENT: BuiltinAgentDefinition = {&#10;  name: &#39;general&#39;,&#10;  description: &#39;General-purpose coding assistant&#39;,&#10;  systemPrompt: &#39;You are a helpful coding assistant...&#39;,&#10;  allowedTools: [&#39;*&#39;],&#10;  model: &#39;sonnet&#39;,&#10;  autoBackground: false,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const EXPLORE: BuiltinAgentDefinition = {&#10;  name: &#39;explore&#39;,&#10;  description: &#39;Codebase exploration and understanding&#39;,&#10;  systemPrompt: &#39;Explore the codebase to answer questions...&#39;,&#10;  allowedTools: [&#39;FileRead&#39;, &#39;Grep&#39;, &#39;Glob&#39;, &#39;Bash&#39;],&#10;  model: &#39;haiku&#39;,&#10;  autoBackground: false,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BuiltinAgentDefinition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  systemPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#